    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`kickoffDevProfileServer` is the development profile server module for the `kickoff` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for dev-scoped profile server activation and runtime topology. Profile capability behavior belongs in the active profile modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Server configuration should preserve privacy, access control, tenant context, and layered overrides."
    }
